            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/202607012328374991_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/202607012328374991_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/202607012328374991_720.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/match1867462date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">艰难过关！英格兰2-1逆转民主刚果晋级16强 凯恩双响+绝杀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260702/zhanbao_image_1867462_1782928345_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260702/zhanbao_image_1867462_1782928345_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260702/zhanbao_image_1867462_1782928345_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>英格兰2-1逆转民主刚果，晋级16强，凯恩双响并贡献绝杀！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/match1867464date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">神剧情！比利时加时3-2淘汰塞内加尔 蒂莱曼斯绝平+点射绝杀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260702/zhanbao_image_1867464_1782945787_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260702/zhanbao_image_1867464_1782945787_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260702/zhanbao_image_1867464_1782945787_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>比利时让二追三，加时赛逆转绝杀塞内加尔！卢卡库破门，蒂莱曼斯双响并贡献点射绝杀。</p><p>【世界杯相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a4455609b6c2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">三狮出击！英格兰逆转晋级将战墨西哥，连续三届世界杯晋级16强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4557c819399.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4557c819399.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4557c819399.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/16决赛，英格兰2-1战胜民主刚果，凯恩双响帮助球队晋级16强。这是英格兰第17次参加世界杯，连续三届打进16强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a45519ad2bf0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔8年重返16强！比利时淘汰塞内加尔，将战美国vs波黑胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020658321150.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020658321150.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020658321150.jpg"> </div><p>比利时3-2绝杀塞内加尔。比利时晋级16强，他们下一轮的对手将是美国与波黑之间的胜者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a45536e85300native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">15场13球！凯恩本届4场5球，世界杯总进球超越贝利，升至历史第6</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45519357153_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45519357153.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a45519357153.jpg"> </div><p>凯恩本届4场5球，个人世界杯15场13球，超越贝利，追平方丹，并列世界杯历史第6！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a45508d24856native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巨星球！凯恩爆射破门达成双响，助英格兰绝杀逆转民主刚果晋级</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a455a01be742.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a455a01be742.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a455a01be742.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/16决赛英格兰对阵民主刚果，第86分钟，凯恩爆射破门，本场梅开二度</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a455640c7c49native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">双响拯救三狮军团！官方：凯恩当选英格兰vs民主刚果全场最佳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020237189550.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020237189550.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020237189550.jpg"> </div><p>英格兰2-1逆转击败民主刚果，本场双响的凯恩当选全场最佳！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a4553f040666native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">改变比赛的男人！戈登第61分钟替换拉什福德登场 连续2次助攻凯恩</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.94" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020153508288.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.94" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.94" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020153508288.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020153508288.jpg"> </div><p>英格兰打进的两球，都来自替补登场的戈登。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a45875cd2f3bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">经典！比利时队长蒂莱曼斯和特罗萨德吵起来了！卢卡库赶忙拉架</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a458e529470f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a458e529470f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a458e529470f.jpg"> </div><p>比利时vs塞内加尔第70分钟，比利时队长蒂莱曼斯和特罗萨德吵起来了！卢卡库赶忙拉架！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a458bf58fc80native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">20分钟前还内讧呢！特罗萨德助攻蒂莱曼斯绝平后，两人深情拥抱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a458f206