0233284511_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020233284511_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020233284511_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，热刺签下纽卡中场托纳利Here we go，球员固定转会费9250万镑+750万镑浮动。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-02/6a4538006483bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">5500万欧新援！官方：拜仁签下摩洛哥国脚前锋赛巴里，签约5年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020001079005.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020001079005_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020001079005_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，拜仁签下25岁摩洛哥国脚前锋赛巴里。据罗马诺报道，赛巴里转会费为5500万欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a452a5a593c9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：布莱顿从热刺签武什科维奇，总价超5000万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="ht